WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
Now that you have your hands in the perfect position and your body is ready,

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:09.160
let's talk about the actual push. To properly pump the heart from the outside,

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:14.640
you need to push down at least two inches for an adult. A good rule of thumb

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.959
is to aim for about one-third of the depth of the person's chest. Take a

00:00:18.959 --> 00:00:23.580
moment now to practice a few deep compressions on your mannequin. Feel how

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.879
much force it takes to reach that two-inch mark. As you practice on your

00:00:27.879 --> 00:00:32.599
mannequins, pay close attention to the feedback they give you. Many mannequins

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:36.639
have lights that turn green or make a clicking sound when you hit that target

00:00:36.639 --> 00:00:38.880
depth.

